From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] People beside the loaded maps on their own ground
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The game hides someone it finds no ground under (MAP_OBJ_STATUS_12), and
it finds the ground only in the loaded maps' collision. On the DS that's
off the screen; the wider field shows people in the maps beside the
loaded ones, and they were hidden till their map was loaded. Patch 0104's
lines in the 3DS's logs (2026-11-06 and 07): four people 17-19 tiles to
the side, hidden for a third of a second to a second; one, at 607,584 by
Solaceon, drawn again only with the player at 617,590, 10 tiles from him
and in the picture. On the PC the maps load at once, so it's drawn by the
time it's in the picture.

Now, when the game finds no ground under someone in the 3DS's picture
(MapObject_PortInReach) in a map that isn't loaded, their ground is
found in that map's own collision (TerrainCollisionManager_PortBesideHeight,
the game's GetHeight for a map not loaded), read from its land data and
kept (LandDataManager_PortBesideBDHC: 4 kept, one read a scene, let go
with the beside maps), as the game finds it once the map's loaded. Not on
a moving height's tile, nor in a field with the simple collisions.

Nothing else changes for them: their tile's behaviour is still not found
till their map's loaded (MAP_OBJ_STATUS_11), and that is what keeps them
from moving (sub_02063478, unk_02069BE0.c), as before.

On the PC (status and height logged): by Solaceon, warped to 626,583 and
walking west, the man at 607,584 (graphics 51) gets his height,
4, by 624,583, where the game gave him 4 once his map was loaded; walking
down from Route 206's gate onto Route 207, the two people at 320,710 and
320,716 get 10 at 303,702, the game's 10 later. Nothing logged by patch
0104 in either. The pictures the same at Veilstone 719,617 and 690,632
and Route 207 317,712 and 330,713; at Jubilife 175,760 and 185,778 the
same but for people walking about, as between any two runs.

